    "updated_at": "2015-08-03T20:41:14Z",
    "body": "For which elements is notification of a base URL change necessary? Can't elements lazily look at the document's current base URL when returning complete URLs? This is how `<a>` works in Blink, for example. Are there cases where a change of base URL triggers some behavior? I tried this with an `<img>` and saw no re-fetch.\n",
